Hi everyone,

I tried unsuccessfully to add renjin to a maven project in netbeans (I'm not very familiar with maven yet).

I got the following errors:

Unpacking C:\Users\arp\.m2\repository\org\renjin\utils\0.9.2597\utils-0.9.2597.jar to C:\Users\arp\Documents\NetBeansProjects\mavenproject1\target\classes with includes "" and excludes ""
Unable to expand to file C:\Users\arp\Documents\NetBeansProjects\mavenproject1\target\classes\org\renjin\utils\$<-.bibentry.RData
Unable to expand to file C:\Users\arp\Documents\NetBeansProjects\mavenproject1\target\classes\org\renjin\utils\?.RData
Unable to expand to file C:\Users\arp\Documents\NetBeansProjects\mavenproject1\target\classes\org\renjin\utils\$<-.person.RData
...

below my pom.xml file:

<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
